<p id="p25">Lucky is a limited series starring Anya Taylor-Joy based on <a href="https://apple.co/4wtLEuk" rel="noopener noreferrer">the bestselling novel of the same name</a> by Marissa Stapley. Taylor-Joy plays a young woman whose former life of crime comes back to haunt her, just as she thinks she’s escaped her past.</p>
