<div class="media-wrapper"><iframe loading="lazy" height="372" width="100%" title="Media player" src="https://embed.tv.apple.com/movie/the-dink/umc.cmc.5tugaz9vt498ajn7q64ypaqxn?itscg=30200&amp;itsct=tv_box_player&amp;mttnsubad=umc.cmc.5tugaz9vt498ajn7q64ypaqxn&amp;at=1001l3bhP&amp;ct=atv_preview&amp;theme=auto" id="embedPlayer" sandbox="allow-forms allow-popups allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation" allow="autoplay *; encrypted-media *; clipboard-write" style="border: 0px; border-radius: 12px; width: 100%; height: 372px; max-width: 660px;"></iframe></div>
<p id="p30">The Dink is a comedy about a former tennis star played by Jake Johnson who has been reduced to coaching kids at a suburban country club. Johnson, who stars with an ensemble cast that includes Ed Harris, Ben Stiller, and Mary Steenburgen, discovers that he loves pickleball, which just may save the ailing country club.</p>
